{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ad9a327290e56c799cfbb1bb009dee6fc2c0b81cd326cf75510e86b29059dd32", "ja": "（今日は撮影で教会にやってきた。\n天使姿の伊織は大好評だった）", "zh": "（今天来教堂进行拍摄。身穿天使装的伊织大受好评。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4d9aa35166bc717349e06180545dab51da969a7128efaeec021cfcf5c5246fe1", "ja": "伊織、今日は一日お疲れさま。\n撮影バッチリだったな。", "zh": "伊织，今天辛苦了一整天。\n拍摄非常顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "6aab35f69309dd71e609a12cfd29d2434a5d6c8ec6e38b941d72d11d521b0992", "ja": "あら、そういう{$P$}こそ、\nお疲れじゃないかしら？　喉とか渇いてない？", "zh": "哎呀，倒是{$P$}你，\n不觉得累吗？口渴不渴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1290b3f13ba7a0ac3487b5cb348493b49a61c72d4227089c647748d140ac01fa", "ja": "え？　いや、俺は平気だけど……。", "zh": "诶？不用，我没事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "9ce93a4b68e9d32632d80a9ea3f257993895d76f61ebe4214fb9aa0f6256d9d9", "ja": "あらそう？　じゃあ他はどう？　何でも言って。この\nスーパーエンジェル伊織ちゃんが叶えてあげる♪", "zh": "哦，是吗？那其他方面呢？有什么都尽管说。这位超级天使伊织会帮你实现愿望♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2a5109d820217a85e201a928cc973eca744df947e0b055b87f514e9afc3b991a", "ja": "どうしたんだ伊織。……って、エンジェル？\nああ、今日の撮影のことか。", "zh": "伊织，怎么了？……等等，天使？  \n啊，是说今天拍摄的事吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "4bdeac779a8e2767a7213fe9595adc118a1d805067b193549e8b2b3695a94829", "ja": "そうよ。なかなかいい仕事だったわね。子羊の願いを\n叶える慈愛の天使……なんてまさに私にぴったりだわ。", "zh": "没错。还真是份不错的工作呢。为小羊实现愿望的  \n慈爱天使……简直再适合我不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "e67b14d620529ed7732be379879828257c96d8a24c1d851f8def75f527c59275", "ja": "だからついでにアンタの願いも叶えてあげるわ。\nさ、子羊ちゃん。さっさと願いを出しなさいよね。", "zh": "所以顺便也帮你实现愿望吧。来，小羊羔，快点把愿望说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cd786fb99f130fdd78a6d23e45c68a0cab537f872d61b236476b004e540d69c0", "ja": "いや、急にそんなこと言われても……あ、じゃあ、\n書類仕事の効率が上がる方法を教えてほしい、とか？", "zh": "不，突然被你这么说，我也……啊，那就……比如，告诉我提高文书工作效率的方法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "33d2534250ddb23a8869f1756d3c7f2f8b8e0a12b805d4cc410721a2b3db9754", "ja": "残念だけど、その願いはダメね。\nそんなの、アンタの努力でなんとかすべきだわ。", "zh": "很遗憾，你这个愿望不行。\n这种事，你应该靠自己的努力解决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1010_p", "source_sha256": "81b6b5faaaff39cf782e9cec69d165b797bf7875eecb661bc5999eacb76c498d", "ja": "え？　そうなのか……。じゃあ亜美と真美に、\nイタズラをさせないようにするにはどうしたら……。", "zh": "诶？是这样吗……。那要怎么做，才能让亚美和真美不去恶作剧呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "c9702c679cdcfcb7eb827f59aa1b5d46861b7812806da3a938a80b7a0236cd67", "ja": "それも無理ね。律子でさえ止められないのに、私が\nどうにかできるわけないでしょ？　はい次。", "zh": "那也不行呢。连律子都阻止不了，我怎么可能做得到？好了，下一个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e7f0cf02c5673d11dbbe49531d4390e7d1b0145284a45280f8db58a7ff25f197", "ja": "……願いを叶えると言ったわりに、\n無理なことが多いな。逆になにが出来るんだ？", "zh": "……明明说了会实现愿望，却有这么多做不到的事啊。那你到底能做到什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "a4a89ffacbd753c4f2399087c1cb2594cedad5ea2f54d51ab94da9aaa41bb86e", "ja": "そりゃ私に願うんだもの。私ができることに\n決まってるじゃない。", "zh": "既然是向我许愿，当然只能是我能做到的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1014_p", "source_sha256": "60c66ed98fb3609fd31e8ecab91fe6d918942ff6485471891c190f25b23342a1", "ja": "ああ、そういうことか。\n……それならひとつしかないな。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事。\n……那就只有一个了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "942c9aea17ff0a681e8dd5fb6b9e03854e1a2f9ba82b380f3f779c7d29a7804d", "ja": "なによ、もったいぶらずに言ってみなさい。", "zh": "什么嘛，别卖关子了，说说看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_1016", "source_sha256": "a158757d8940174fa5ae7a15688597863c3999620311a20db4d5738b968f82a2", "ja": "トップアイドルに\nなってほしい。", "zh": "希望你成为顶级偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c62198331d9262fa0643dc2586150e0cbad067a7508b8cdb1ecb40ad90037ad9", "ja": "水瀬伊織に、\nトップアイドルになってほしい。……だな。", "zh": "我希望水濑伊织能成为顶尖偶像。……嗯，应该就是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_2001_007ior", "source_sha256": "143d11bf94f490eb39b4a36783c6905edc414f0a3497f2596239c6c26c2c4817", "ja": "……あら、なかなかな願いごとをするじゃない。", "zh": "……哎呀，你许的愿望还真敢说呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_2002_p", "source_sha256": "ae4de7aa64dca3135f7bfb619984f71f52041a5927a613e1328ca8ac9b8286ed", "ja": "どうだ。頼めるか？", "zh": "怎么样？能拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0253_2003_007ior", "source_sha256": "fb8247d5cf4d09f02a1fd91737a880f2527a6dbe1ce7bf1e9ec089cf076aaf75", "ja": "もちろんよ。見てなさい{$P$}！\nその願い、きっちり叶えてあげるわ！　にひひっ♪", "zh": "那是当然。看好了{$P$}！\n你的愿望，我一定会替你实现的！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
